ac_1 = "Given the canonical projection tests at services/launchpad/indexer/internal/processor/repair_54_test.go:160 and services/launchpad/indexer/internal/processor/repair_54_test.go:1098, when each commits its real projection and requests the mounted status route with explicit canonical stream, delivery health and lag budget, then HTTP 200 reports that stream's committed height and one pool and swap, while requests with missing mode, wrong stream or missing delivery configuration return HTTP 503 without weakening services/launchpad/indexer/internal/httpapi/status.go:62 or services/launchpad/indexer/internal/httpapi/status.go:94."

